  "source": "Native hanging square duck-weave flax canvas on thin pickets; all16 N1/E2/S4/W8 states. One central tan-primary picket with red cap; E/W broad tan fabric, red top hem and lower outer red fold; N/S narrow red edge-on strip with tan ties. Native w/r tint. Full16x24 common cell becomes256square. Connected edges intentionally touch/cross frame; other edges must remain clear.",
  "authored": "Complete 3D cloth/pickets, hidden thickness and45degree cardinal map camera are authored estimates. No roof tent, masonry, decorative swag, arbitrary new gate join or native behavior.",
  "required": "Review all16 states versus source and fixed manual geometry. Check self-joins and corners/T/cross in joined proof, continuity, duplicate caps/borders, contact, clipping, source palette/material roles and intended16x24/24x36 size. Named gate has different paint group; attachment diagram documents limitations and anchors only.",
  "expected_output": "Compact findings with state/region/evidence/confidence/severity and correction principle; recommendation pass or hold. Do not edit/regenerate/delegate. No native acceptance claim."
}
